        "original_id": "cf09d98e-1f93-55b3-90bb-966641852068",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Naked Soldier, Naked Weapon, Naked Killer\n- People: Tony Ching, Maggie Q, Anya Wu, Daniel Wu\n- Concepts: \"Naked\" film series\n\nFacts:\n- Naked Killer was released in 1992 as part of the \"Naked\" film series.\n- Naked Weapon was released in 2002 as a Hong Kong action-thriller film in the \"Naked\" film series.\n- Naked Weapon was directed by Tony Ching.\n- Naked Weapon starred Maggie Q, Anya Wu, and Daniel Wu.\n- Naked Soldier is the third installment of the \"Naked\" film series, following Naked Killer and Naked Weapon.",
